            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for a formal resolution, then the Kannada for to include."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಹತ್ತಿಕ್ಕು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹತ್ತಿಕ್ಕು — hattikku — \"to suppress; to stifle\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅವಳು ತನ್ನ ಕೋಪವನ್ನು ಹತ್ತಿಕ್ಕಿದಳು. avaḷu tanna kōpavannu hattikkidaḷu. She suppressed her anger."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಹತ್ತಿಕ್ಕಿದೆ, hattikkide."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Of feelings and of protests."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹತ್ತಿಕ್ಕು (hattikku) is a Kannada verb whose origin is not settled: DEDR does not list it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
